 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nCrestview Supplies LLC                                     MASTER SERVICES\n450 Madison Avenue, 73301 Austin, United States           AGREEMENT\nVAT No: US37-0442467\n\nFROM                                                       BILL TO PAID [circled]\nCrestview Supplies LLC                                     Summit Medical Devices Inc\n450 Madison Avenue                                         450 Madison Avenue\n73301 Austin                                               44101 Cleveland\nUnited States                                              United States\nVAT: US37-0442467\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 03/06/2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Crestview Supplies LLC, with its registered office at 450 Madison Avenue,\nAustin (\"Party A\"), and Summit Medical Devices Inc, with its registered office at 450 Madison Avenue,\nCleveland (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A   Crestview Supplies LLC / Sarah Mitchell\nParty B   Summit Medical Devices Inc / David Kim\nDate      03/06/2026",
